## Installation Summary

Ubuntu Server 24.04.4 LTS was successfully installed using the official ARM64 Live Server ISO image.

During installation the following configuration was applied:

- Guided storage configuration
- Logical Volume Manager (LVM)
- OpenSSH Server installed
- Ubuntu Pro skipped
- Automatic network configuration (DHCP)
- Hostname configured as **app01**
- Administrative user **shourab** created

After installation, the installation media was removed and the virtual machine rebooted successfully.

